@startuml
 title Authentication flow
participant "user (web/mobile)" as U
participant Kong as K
participant "ms-iam" as IAM
participant "service of domain" as SV

U -> K: POST /API/v1/auth/login
K -> IAM: credentials
IAM --> U: Access 15 min + cookie refresh 30 days
U -> K: GET /fleet/API/buses (Bearer)
K -> SV: Reenvía token
SV --> U: 200 + data per School
@enduml

